  "title": "EEGEyeNet Dataset",
  "description": "A BIDS-standardized subset of the EEGEyeNet dataset containing simultaneously recorded EEG and eye-tracking data from a single subject. The original EEGEyeNet resource was designed as a dataset and benchmark for eye movement prediction from EEG. This version was reformatted to BIDS to support reuse and standardized analysis.",
  "methods_description": "Simultaneous EEG and eye-tracking data were recorded from a subject as part of the original EEGEyeNet study, and later converted into BIDS format.",
